# The authoritative field map's emitter: reads reports/custom-settings.fields.json
# over the pinned image 4 (conversion-table pointers) and image 5 (commit
# dispatcher arm words) and writes the shared table the storage kernel
# (menu/recipe_bank_fields.inc) and the host oracle
# (host/FujiAF/RecipeBankFields.hs) read. --check re-emits in memory and fails
# on any difference from the checked-in files.
haskell_binary(
    name = "emit-recipe-bank-fields",
    srcs = ["EmitRecipeBankFields.hs"],
    ghcopts = [
        "-Wall",
        "-Werror",
        "-O2",
